        <li><a href="#posts" class="hover:text-theme-primary">Wire Diameter, Frames, and Post Specs</a></li>
        <li><a href="#toppings" class="hover:text-theme-primary">Toppings: Barbed Wire, Razor Wire, and Detection</a></li>
        <li><a href="#standards" class="hover:text-theme-primary">Standards and Test Requirements</a></li>
